        <div class="v2-rit__item" data-reveal style="--d:.12s"><div class="v2-rit__img"><img src="{{ img_kitchen }}" alt="Coffee and an open Bible on a kitchen table" loading="lazy">{% render 'scene-shop', scene: 'fem-scene-kitchen-table.jpg' %}</div><span class="v2-rit__num">02</span><h3>Pour</h3><p>Brew it slowly. The devotion is on the back, short enough to read while the coffee blooms.</p></div>
        <div class="v2-rit__item" data-reveal style="--d:.24s"><div class="v2-rit__img"><img src="{{ img_sill }}" alt="Three coffees on a sunlit windowsill" loading="lazy">{% render 'scene-shop', scene: 'fem-scene-windowsill-trio.jpg' %}</div><span class="v2-rit__num">03</span><h3>Renew</h3><p>Each month brings a new devotion and prayer, so the morning never repeats.</p></div>
