      <p data-reveal style="--d:.16s">A warm spiced holiday blend and a peppermint dark-chocolate roast, each with an Advent devotion on the back. Gone after Christmas.</p>
      <div data-reveal style="--d:.24s"><a class="v2-btn v2-btn--gold" href="/collections/seasonal">Shop the season</a></div>
    </div>
